          "summary": "Football Diversions - SWFC, SUFC, SUWFC, BFC, and RUFC Home Games (2026 - 2027 Season)",
          "description": "Before, during, and after Sheffield Wednesday FC, Sheffield United FC, Sheffield United Women FC, Rotherham United FC, and Barnsley FC Home Games, various roads in the areas around the above teams stadiums are closed or inaccessible due to badly parked cars.\n\nPlease see below for diversion information related to each football club.",
          "advice": "SWFC - Hillsborough Stadium\n\nLeppings Lane\n\nServices 18A, 18A, 31, 97, 98, M92 from Hillsborough Interchange to divert via Langsett Road, Bamforth Street, Penistone Road.\n\nServices 18, 18A, 31, 97, 98, M92 towards Hillsborough Interchange to divert via Penistone Road, Bradfield Road, Langsett Road.\n \nPenistone Road\n\nServices 7, 8, 86 towards Wadsley Bridge to divert via Herries Road South, Herries Road.\nServices 7, 8, 86 towards City Centre are unaffected.\n\nFox Hill Road\n\nService 86 to divert from Fox Hill Crescent via Fox Hill Road, Wilcox Road, Halifax Road in both directions.\n\nDonovan Road\n\nService 98 to divert via Southey Green Road, Wordsworth Avenue in both directions.",
          "reason": {
            "category": "MiscellaneousReason",
            "value": "specialEvent"
          },
